            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for using 'mini.starter'! Answers:\r\na) I believe, you are using Neovim nightly. This seems like a consequence of neovim/neovim#17358. I have a fix for that, but I would like to wait for an official resolution of this issue.\r\nc) Yeah, I feel you. But they are used for quering items. I added `<Alt-j>` and `<Alt-k>` for more familiar navigation.",
